{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12132","headline":"寄任山人 · 钱起","name":"寄任山人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天阶崇黼黻，世路有趋竞。\n独抱中孚爻，谁知苦寒咏。\n行潦难朝海，散材空遇圣。\n岂无鸣凤时，其如问津命。\n所思青山郭，再梦绿萝径。\n林泉春可游，羡尔得其性。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12132.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12132","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}